1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:04,120
Your customers live just two streets away.

2
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:08,500
But their orders go to a warehouse 30 km away.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,400
PawanSetu builds the bridge back.

4
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:16,750
A neighbour orders on her phone.

5
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:20,700
Your shop packs it, right off your shelf.

6
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:25,200
A local rider brings it home in minutes.

7
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:30,000
Then the next order. And the next.

8
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:33,550
Every shop on the street, online.

9
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:38,600
PawanSetu. Your shop, your neighbourhood.
